},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Riptide Rush","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The trench lord moves up to 500 feet in a straight line through the water without triggering reactions. Creatures within 15 feet of a square that the trench lord passes through during this movement must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:34] save or be @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"eWUdBFE12SFpC82M","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Torrent","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The trench lord vastly increases their internal pressure before releasing it in a concentrated blast of boiling water. All creatures in a @Template[type:line|distance:90] take @Damage[4d12[bludgeoning],2d12[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:34|basic] save). A creature that fails this save is pushed 30 feet away from the trench lord, or 60 feet on a critical failure.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","primal","water"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":3},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"AmOJKgJKkiov6nbA","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Vent","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The trench lord's body expels the superheated chemicals that churn within. All creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30] take @Damage[6d6[poison],6d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:34|basic] save). A creature that fails this save is also @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). The trench lord can't use Vent again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Vent]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["fire","poison","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.4.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"8avTmym93JMuFkxr","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}}],"effects":[],"sort":600000,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.8.0"}}